ithub.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/labels/team-Core","name":"team-Core","color":"f1f442","default":false,"description":"Skyframe, bazel query, BEP, options parsing, bazelrc"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":{"login":"michaeledgar","id":65914,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1OTE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65914?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaeledgar","html_url":"https://github.com/michaeledgar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaeledgar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaeledgar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaeledgar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaeledgar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaeledgar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaeledgar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaeledgar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaeledgar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaeledgar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"michaeledgar","id":65914,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1OTE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65914?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaeledgar","html_url":"https://github.com/michaeledgar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaeledgar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaeledgar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaeledgar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaeledgar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaeledgar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaeledgar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaeledgar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaeledgar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaeledgar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":15,"created_at":"2019-09-20T21:42:25Z","updated_at":"2020-01-17T17:35:00Z","closed_at":"2020-01-17T17:35:00Z","author_association":"MEMBER","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Let T be a target, `foo-outputs` and `bar-outputs` be output groups, `foo-action` and `bar-action` be actions in T, and `foo.out` and `bar.out` be outputs generated by `foo-action` and `bar-action` respectively.\r\n\r\n- If we build T and request for `foo-outputs`, we expect `foo.out` to be in a `NamedSetOfFiles` in the BEP output. This is WAI.\r\n- If we build T and request for `foo-outputs` and `bar-outputs`, we expect `foo.out` and `bar.out` to be in in their own `NamedSetOfFiles`, since they were generated by different actions `foo-action` and `bar-action`. This is WAI.\r\n- If we build T and request for `foo-outputs` and `bar-outputs`, **and `bar-action` fails**, we expect that `foo.out` to still be listed in BEP. However, this is not the case and `foo.out` is missing, even with `--keep_going`. \r\n- Additionally, if there is a target U that depends on T, U's `foo-outputs` files will also be missing from the BEP.\r\n\r\nThis has caused issues with IJwB's Java integration. See this issue for the diagnosis and a repro project. https://github.com/bazelbuild/intellij/issues/1167#issuecomment-533693212\r\n\r\nThe intuitive BEP state here is that the `foo-outputs` files should still be listed, regardless of failing actions requested by other output groups.","closed_by":{"login":"bazel-io","id":15028808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MDI4ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15028808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","u